  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>The information and calculators provided on caloriecalculatorfree.com are for general educational and informational purposes only. They are <strong>not</strong> intended to be, and should not be taken as, medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the guidance of a qualified physician, registered dietitian, or other healthcare professional with any questions about your health, nutrition, or fitness.</p>

  <h2>Estimates, not exact figures</h2>
  <p>Our calculators use established predictive equations to produce estimates. Real energy needs and body-composition values vary between individuals due to genetics, muscle mass, medical conditions, medications, and other factors. Results should be treated as a starting point and validated against your own real-world progress.</p>

  <h2>Individual circumstances</h2>
  <p>Do not use these tools to self-diagnose or to make significant changes to your diet or exercise routine without professional supervision — particularly if you are pregnant or breastfeeding, under 18, elderly, have a history of disordered eating, or have a medical condition such as diabetes, heart disease, or kidney disease.</p>

